LOCATION:Offsite: 25 Pier 4 Blvd.\, Boston
DESCRIPTION:Category: Sports & Games\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 1 spot lef
 t\nStatus: Waitlist Only\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/even
 ts/206904\n\n2:00PM Pro-Led Instruction\, 2:30PM Open Play\, 4:00PM - Reco
 very and Member Mingling\n\nJoin us for an offsite afternoon of play as Th
 e 'Quin House takes over the courts at Ballers in the Seaport. Whether you
 're picking up the racquet for the first time\, or have tried the sport an
 d would like to learn more\, members are invited to experience two of tod
 ay’s most exciting racquet sports\, pickleball and padel\, in a lively\,
  social setting.\n\nThe afternoon will begin with professional instructors
  Mike Millet for pickleball and Colin Lamusta for padel\, giving members 
 guidance before moving into rotating play and friendly matches across both
  sports\, guided by the Ballers team. Members will have the opportunity to
  rotate between pickleball and padel courts to experience both racquet spo
 rts with pros and members. Post play\, members can stick around to mix\, m
 ingle\, and enjoy food and drinks for purchase at the Ballers food trucks 
 and bar. After play\, members are welcome to stick around to mix\, mingle
 \, and enjoy food and drinks available for purchase from the Ballers food 
 trucks and bar.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members o
 nly. We kindly ask that all cancellations be made at least 48 hours prior 
 to the start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/206904
CATEGORIES:Sports & Games
END:VEVENT
