SUMMARY:Hands On Impact: Cradles to Crayons
LOCATION:Offsite - The Giving Factory
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Impact Fund\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 18 sp
 ots left\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/e
 vents/195628\n\nMake an impact with Cradles to Crayons through a hands-on 
 volunteer opportunity. Cradles to Crayons is a nonprofit committed to endi
 ng children’s clothing insecurity in the U.S. Since 2002\, they have pro
 vided more than 6 million packages of essentials - including clothing\, sh
 oes\, diapers\, and school supplies - to children across the country.\n\nA
 t the Cradles to Crayons “Giving Factory\,” you will take part in sort
 ing\, quality-checking\, and packaging donations that go directly to child
 ren and families in need - helping ensure every child can arrive at school
  feeling confident\, prepared\, and valued.\n\n*This event is complimentar
 y and reserved for members\, plus one registered guest age 6+. Please wear
  comfortable clothing you don’t mind getting dirty\, along with close-to
 ed shoes. The warehouse is not climate controlled\, so dress with the weat
 her in mind.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/195628
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Impact Fund
