 ng finale in Munich. Wander from Marienplatz to the Viktualienmarkt\, disc
 over neighborhood markets and local boutiques\, and savor one last taste o
 f the season before raising a glass together over a farewell dinner overlo
 oking the National Theatre. An extraordinary journey through the tradition
 s\, flavors\, and unmistakable magic of the European holiday season awaits
 .\n\nSingle Occupancy | $6\,950\n\nDouble Occupancy | $10\,150\n\n*Reserva
 tions are non-refundable and non-transferable in order to guarantee accom
